This product includes data created by GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org/),
used under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

Specifically: backend/data/cities1000.csv is derived from the GeoNames
"cities1000" export (places with population >= 1000), trimmed to the
columns lat, lon, population, name, country, admin1. It is used to seed
the population-weighted grid (pop_cell) that drives procedural Veil
tear generation (scripts/seed-pop-grid.ts).

No changes were made to the underlying geographic facts; only column
selection and formatting.
